abstract: "Bookkeeping for a salon or spa keeps card tips as money owed to staff, books booth rent as income, separates retail product sales from services, holds gift cards as a liability until they are used, and grosses each card deposit back up before processor fees. This kit has the accounts, a checklist and a worked month that ties."
